addressing \"full cord responsiveness\" by adjusting section padding, outer container sizing, and the inner card sizing, to ensure perfect responsiveness.\n\n\n**Scaling Text Components**\n\nI\'m now optimizing text elements within the newsletter card for improved readability and visual hierarchy across devices. I\'m focusing on headline and description, ensuring they scale appropriately. The input pill container sizing is also a focus, including responsive flexbox layouts for diverse screen sizes.\n\n\n**Enhancing Input Aesthetics**\n\nI\'m now implementing the email input and subscribe button\'s responsive styling for the newsletter card. My priority is achieving a premium, streamlined look, inspired by leading fitness and sportswear sites. I\'m focusing on a flex-row layout for a sleek, single-line presentation across most screens, with adjustments for smaller devices. I am using responsive flexbox for input, and button, with flexible sizing and padding, and a rounded border.\n\n\n"
