`right` and `left` offsets. I\'m also ensuring the tablet and desktop layouts are appropriately scaled and positioned, aiming for a consistent visual impact. Finally, I\'m verifying the SVG sizes of the droplets to confirm they\'re all consistent.\n\n\n**Scaling Droplet Proportions**\n\nI\'ve just refined the droplet scaling within the newsletter card, ensuring it scales proportionally with the increased tablet card size using updated widths. I\'m also now focusing on the success view: I\'m implementing responsive widths and typography to prevent shrinking and enhance readability, ensuring a better user experience across all devices. Finally, I\'ve checked the container padding in `NewsletterSection.tsx` and am verifying that the droplets still look great.\n\n\n"
