padding (28px total), the inner width is 242px. The form container will take up 100% of this space. After accounting for the pill border and padding (~14px) and the button width (~68px), there\'s approximately 160px remaining for the email input. The \"Enter your email\" placeholder at `text-[11px]` needs ~95px, which fits with room to spare! The small button is exactly as requested, and on the right side. I\'ve also checked the positioning of the top-right and bottom-left droplets and made the required adjustments for their positioning on mobile.\n\n\n**Verifying Visual Balance**\n\nI\'m now satisfied with the smaller mobile card and confirming that the design remains visually balanced. The positioning of the `-10 xl:-left-12 z-10 pointer-events-none` element looks great on small screens, with no clipping or overlap. I\'ve also checked the title swoosh, which looks balanced, with the `text-lg sm:text-2xl` sizing on the headline. Furthermore, I\'m verifying the `NewsletterSuccessView` component on mobile to ensure a consistent look and feel with the smaller card design.\n\n\n\n"
